# Altare state redundancy audit

Source: /workspace/scratch/212c580ada5b/altare-editor-review-20261103
Version: 0.12.3
Generated: 2026-11-03T17:42:50.011Z

Enumerate every declared state; shallow-merge matching permutation components in order; evaluate bone_visibility; recursively sort object keys and preserve arrays; SHA-256 effective component JSON. Identifiers inside components, unused material bindings, collision, and tick behavior are retained. Block identifier/description and latent states are excluded.

Declared: **80000**, across 414 block IDs. Canonical component signatures: **70496**; duplicate outputs: **9504**. Additional cross-ID exact duplicates: 0.
Prior noncanonical count: 70,496; canonicalization delta: 0. Sorting keys did not change the result.

